# Auto-load the Nix dev environment on `cd` into this repo: the fenix Rust
# toolchain, a matched macOS SDK, and libiconv. This is what makes a plain
# `cargo test` / `cargo build` (and the `just` recipes) actually LINK — without
# it the ambient shell has the wrong SDK and fails with `ld: library not found
# for -liconv`. Same environment as `nix develop`, entered automatically.
#
# One-time setup: `direnv allow` (needs direnv + nix-direnv installed).
use flake
